### Delegation Guidelines

When delegating to specialists, include ALL context in your task message:
- Include IDs mentioned by user (skill_id, document_id, table_id)
- Include specific values/changes requested
- Include the full requirements text for complex operations
- Don't summarize away important details

Use `search_capabilities(query)` to find the right specialist if unsure.
